From 8bde20a56506cc2dd3edc95d7a3cb9ca55558968 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:54:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-52: four fixes found by a review of R28-R44
 (0.52.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

An independent read-only review of the R28-R44 diff found these; each one
checked against the code, then fixed and tested:
- 改回 DFM wrote nothing when one control had two differences on the same
  tag (Left + Font.Bold of one button: two edits of its start tag = "the
  same source changed twice (overlapping)", refused). applySourceEdit now
  applies every change of one tag to that tag's text -- one edit of it.
  Every batch gains (a panel change on many, editMany, group drags).
- Tab 順序 showed every checkbox as "not in the DFM": a generated TCheckBox
  has its name on <label class="ckb" id>, the <input> has none. A stop
  without an id now belongs to the label around it (HotPlate: 11 stops
  compared, not 8). A name reached twice counts once.
- DFM 位置 switched off while a comparison was still waiting for the page:
  the late answer switched it back on. A generation counter now drops it.
- cmdPlace works on the designer it was put down on (setActive first), not
  whichever is active.
Also: with Tab 順序 on, the stops are read again at most every 0.7 s (and
after an edit) instead of on every mouse move.

Tests: smoke (a batch of style + style + attribute on spbSave = one edit of
its tag with all three; turned off while comparing = stays off), probe (a
checkbox named by its label is the 4th stop, blue; the non-grey badges are
exactly the compared ones), real VS Code (spbSave moved AND bold -> both
back to the DFM in the source, two undos; HotPlate Tab order: 11 compared).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
